<metadata><name>Black Butte</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:255-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.407489" lon="-121.601489"><ele>1139.2</ele><name>Road 11 at Road 1110</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:road-11-1110-junction (OSM node 39547571); confidence: high; pdf_page: 257; quote: Proceed on paved Road 11 to Road 1110. Drive up 1110 as far as possible</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.394912" lon="-121.647541"><ele>1489.1</ele><name>Road 1110 end, upper Black Butte Trailhead</name><desc>source: OSM way 5445992 (Forest Road 1110) west end, by OSM way 559972070 Black Butte Trailhead (upper); confidence: high; pdf_page: 257; book_elev_ft: 4800; quote: proceed on skis to the end of the road (4,800 feet) where the summer foot trail starts</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.400144" lon="-121.636892"><ele>1953.1</ele><name>Black Butte summit (lookout)</name><desc>source: OSM way 545772246 (Black Butte Trail #4026) summit end; GNIS/OSM volcano node 357307133 at 44.400084,-121.636459; confidence: high; pdf_page: 257; book_elev_ft: 6436; quote: the summer trail climbs northward moderately, then switchbacks for the final, long traverse</desc></wpt>
